    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia**_\n\n## Summary\nDesign doc `docs/architecture/devonthink-emacs-integration.org` for a deeper DEVONthink and Emacs integration: search (DEVONthink and `litdb`), page-level links back to DEVONthink, browsing and tagging from Emacs, and a two-way link between a record and its litnote. Page-level indexing is limited to documents with annotations or a read `read-status`, to keep the `litdb` index small.\n\nDesign only; no code. Nothing was run in Emacs, and the page-anchor syntax, annotation-count semantics, custom metadata field and URL handler are listed in the doc as the first things to verify.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Read the doc and decide on the open points (record-side link location, URL handler).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
